.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2024/11/FYI-Yachts-and-OKEAN-Yachts-at-the-2024-Fort-Lauderdale-International-Boat-Show-Recap-7.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2024/11/FYI-Yachts-and-OKEAN-Yachts-at-the-2024-Fort-Lauderdale-International-Boat-Show-Recap-7.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /> </a><a href=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2024/11/FYI-Yachts-and-OKEAN-Yachts-at-the-2024-Fort-Lauderdale-International-Boat-Show-Recap-6.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2024/11/FYI-Yachts-and-OKEAN-Yachts-at-the-2024-Fort-Lauderdale-International-Boat-Show-Recap-6.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /> </a><a href=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2024/11/FYI-Yachts-and-OKEAN-Yachts-at-the-2024-Fort-Lauderdale-International-Boat-Show-Recap-5.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2024/11/FYI-Yachts-and-OKEAN-Yachts-at-the-2024-Fort-Lauderdale-International-Boat-Show-Recap-5.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /> </a><a href=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2024/11/FYI-Yachts-and-OKEAN-Yachts-at-the-2024-Fort-Lauderdale-International-Boat-Show-Recap-4.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2024/11/FYI-Yachts-and-OKEAN-Yachts-at-the-2024-Fort-Lauderdale-International-Boat-Show-Recap-4.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /> </a><a href=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2024/11/FYI-Yachts-and-OKEAN-Yachts-at-the-2024-Fort-Lauderdale-International-Boat-Show-Recap-3.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2024/11/FYI-Yachts-and-OKEAN-Yachts-at-the-2024-Fort-Lauderdale-International-Boat-Show-Recap-3.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /> </a><p>The 2024 Fort Lauderdale International Boat Show (FLIBS), held from October 30 to November 3, concluded its 65th edition with exceptional success. Attracting over 100,000 visitors and featuring more than 1,300 boats across seven prime locations, the event once again solidified its position as the world’s largest and most prestigious in-water boat show.</p><p>FYI Yachts was proud to showcase two stunning models from OKEAN Yachts—the 2025 OKEAN 52′ and 57’—at the Bahia Mar Yachting Center. These yachts, known for their innovative design and luxurious craftsmanship, captivated visitors with their sleek lines, advanced technology, and impeccable attention to detail. Throughout the show, FYI Yachts engaged with over 300 attendees, discussing yacht ownership opportunities and exploring customization options. The level of interest was remarkable, with numerous promising proposals on the table for both models.</p><p>The 2024 show featured an impressive array of global yacht debuts, cutting-edge marine technology, and some of the most luxurious yachts in the world. It reaffirmed FLIBS as the premier event in the global yachting calendar. For those unable to attend in person, highlights of the newest models and technological advancements are still available to explore online, offering a comprehensive look at the future of yachting.</p><p>Looking ahead, the 66th Annual Fort Lauderdale International Boat Show will take place from October 29 to November 2, 2025. As the world’s largest in-water boat show, FLIBS continues to push the boundaries of luxury yachting, and FYI Yachts is already preparing to showcase its newest models and innovations. We can’t wait to see you there and share what we have in store for 2025!</p><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/-aDAB0OjiXw?si=ukMbH_7HJ5KrZr_q\" allowfullscreen loading=\"lazy\"></iframe><b>Share this post</b><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/sharer/sharer.php?u={URL}\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> </a><a href=\"https://x.com/intent/tweet?url={URL}\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> 